  Port                        Follows
  --------------------------  -----------------------------------------------
  src/core/chisq.ts           R's src/nmath/pnchisq.c and src/nmath/qgamma.c
  src/core/norm.ts            R's src/nmath/qnorm.c
  src/core/tdist.ts           R's src/nmath/pnt.c
