Note on `dqrdc2`: this is not the original LINPACK `dqrdc`. It is R Core's
modification of it, adding the limited column-pivoting rule that causes
`lm()` to report an aliased coefficient as NA rather than divide by a
near-zero pivot. That modification is R's work and is distributed under R's
GPL; the port of its behavior is covered by section 1 above.


